{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sauna Simulator&quot; is a funny business simulator. Buy premises, equip them with a sauna stove and start earning from it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a small area at your disposal, available in the demo version, as well as several exciting side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/58581f4e5507630dd14e522f1858b21e.poster.avif?t=1756789144\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/58581f4e5507630dd14e522f1858b21e.webm?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/58581f4e5507630dd14e522f1858b21e.mp4?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience what it's like to manage a small area, deal with customers, hire workers, and simultaneously purchase the items you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to small quests, the demo version features one large quest related to zombies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/a6e61262d3048e1ade757f5fb35b14be.poster.avif?t=1756789144\" width=590 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/a6e61262d3048e1ade757f5fb35b14be.webm?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/a6e61262d3048e1ade757f5fb35b14be.mp4?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers leave feedback. If your customers don't like your sauna: poor service, dirty facilities, etc., they will definitely leave a bad review. If, on the other hand, you take complete care of your customers, they will leave you a positive rating. Based on these ratings, you will see the average rating of your sauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/c26e040c5b5165764fe12c34a2c1bf29.poster.avif?t=1756789144\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/c26e040c5b5165764fe12c34a2c1bf29.webm?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/c26e040c5b5165764fe12c34a2c1bf29.mp4?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should not forget about safety. If your stove is cheap, then it will have a high chance of catching fire. In such cases you will need fire extinguishers, which of course you can buy at the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/e9a560582e1139eccfc73b19c67817db.poster.avif?t=1756789144\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/e9a560582e1139eccfc73b19c67817db.webm?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/e9a560582e1139eccfc73b19c67817db.mp4?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspections. At a certain point, an inspection will come to you. The person will check the condition of the fire extinguishers, the cleanliness of the premises, etc. Inspections can be planned or unplanned. If your sauna has bad grades - unscheduled inspections will be frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/ce3973dea9a185013cbb6ad346ec7e59.poster.avif?t=1756789144\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/ce3973dea9a185013cbb6ad346ec7e59.webm?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/extras/ce3973dea9a185013cbb6ad346ec7e59.mp4?t=1756789144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developing now by only one person - S1NGLE.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944220?t=1756789144","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944220?t=1756789144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/7cb5f6e2ae4b7e79e065bb2e84373be640b37b7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756789144","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944220/7cb5f6e2ae4b7e79e065bb2e84373be640b37b7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756789144","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sauna Simulator&quot; is a funny business simulator. Buy premises, equip them with a sauna stove and start earning from it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a small area at your disposal, available in the demo version, as well as several exciting side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_